<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91452" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύκν-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thick cloth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				235
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπυκώμασι</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dense mass, concentration</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.4U.
			</span></i>, al.; <i>crowded detail</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. στερέμνιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					3.11
				</span></i>
			; <i>compression</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.41
			</span></i>; <i>close order</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π. τῶν πολεμίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					6.1.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν σαρισῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Aem.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Phil.</u>
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>close planting</i> or <i>growth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κυάμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					17.1.15
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δένδρων, τῶν ὄζων</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.37
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				55
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν τριχῶν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				66
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in pl.,=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυκνόν</span> (v. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυκνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111.2
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				531a
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
